# TinaCMS — hosted editing (TinaCloud)
#
# Local mode works without these (see `npm run tina:dev`). Set these once
# the operator registers this repo at https://app.tina.io so editors can
# use the visual /admin editor against the LIVE deployed site (not just
# localhost). Until set, tina/config.ts falls back to local mode.
# TINA_CLIENT_ID=
# TINA_TOKEN=
